{
  "rootCauseHypothesis": "The hosted app likely has a regression in the round navigation keyboard handler: pressing ArrowLeft does not trigger state/URL updates, so the election view stays on Round 2 and the query string remains round=2. This could be caused by missing event-listener registration in the deployed build, a logic bug that only handles ArrowRight or ignores ArrowLeft, or a routing/state-sync issue where the keyboard action changes neither the component state nor the URL. Underlying error: TEST FAILURE\n\nPressing the left-arrow key did not return the election view to Round 1. The page remained on Round 2.\n\nObservations:\n- The page showed “Round 2 of 2” after the left-arrow key was pressed.\n- The URL still contained round=2.",
