    "rationale": "Implement or restore keyboard navigation for the election view on the hosting side: add a keydown listener that handles ArrowLeft to decrement the round when round>1, update the UI state, and sync the URL query param back to round=1 (or whatever the previous valid round is). Also ensure the listener is attached when the component mounts in the deployed build and that no overlay/modal or focus issue is preventing the document from receiving keyboard events. If the issue is only in production, check the deployed bundle for a regression where the left-arrow handler was removed, disabled, or gated behind the wrong route/state condition."
